{"about_the_game":"Slice &amp; Dice is a puzzle game where the objective is to place the die in the goal frame. Using realistic physics, the player can move the die by affecting the cubes within the environment through a variety of actions like slicing and destroying them. It\u2019s a party game that players and viewers alike can enjoy!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25cf VR Expo 2017 - Best Creative Game Awards</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25cf VR Expo 2017 - Best Made With Unity Awards.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25cf Made with Unity Awards 2017 - Top3 of VR Game</ul><br>Currently we have 100 stages and more than 20 hours play time for average players. <br><br>Slice &amp; Dice is a VR puzzle game where the objective is to place the \u2018Dice\u2019 into the \u2018Dice hole\u2019. The player can find the \u2018Dice hole\u2019 on the floor of each stage. There are various kinds of \u2018Cubes\u2019 and different cubes have various physical properties. The dice is stacked on the cubes and the player must solve the puzzles and cut through the cubes to move the dice into the dice hole. As the player progresses through each stage, the number of the floors within the stage increases.<br><br>This game provides enjoyment not only to the player but thanks to the cooperative nature of solving puzzles, also the viewers will enjoy it through advice and coaching as there are multiple ways to solve the levels.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d1356b9159abb028125c8be30e172d4684a8dca5.jpg","localized_name":"The Kind Mr. Robot","name":"The Kind Mr. Robot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/637870/d1356b9159abb028125c8be30e172d4684a8dca5.jpg"},{"icon":"6ec453d54fd9e9266b796b1da13ed6807c9ccc4d.jpg","localized_name":"Baby step","name":"Baby step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/637870/6ec453d54fd9e9266b796b1da13ed6807c9ccc4d.jpg"},{"icon":"1df8e19957ebc70d777b775cae0b9799079d329a.jpg","localized_n